{"id":"acusado","lemma":"acusado","pos":"adj","rank":1591,"glosses":["accused","marked; pronounced"],"ipa":"/akuˈsado/","forms":{"feminine":"acusada","masculinePlural":"acusados","femininePlural":"acusadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-acusado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom es el acusado.","en":"Tom is the defendant.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804284"},{"text":"Ella fue acusada de mentir.","en":"She was accused of lying."},{"text":"¿Por qué confesaron los acusados?","en":"Why did the accused confess?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706485"},{"text":"La mayoría de las personas acusadas fueron condenadas a muerte.","en":"Most of the accused were sentenced to death."},{"text":"Él fue acusado de asesinato.","en":"He was accused of murder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/537893"}]}